msgid "This implementation is adapted from the nuclear shell-model application in [qiskit-fortran](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fortran), the Fortran bindings for Qiskit. Build and run the version in the Fortran directory linked in the preceding note rather than the upstream application, because it includes corrections to interaction mass scaling and antisymmetrized pair-exchange phases.\n"
